    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/hero {\"title\":\"A dedicated circumcision clinic in North-West London\\n\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/groups /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/trust-strip /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/intro {\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOur clinic is in North-West London, about fifteen minutes from Wembley Stadium, outside the congestion charge, with free street parking all around it. We circumcise babies, infants, children, teenagers and adult men, day in and day out. It is what this clinic does.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur two practitioners have more than forty years of combined experience between them, in the UK and abroad, and have carried out thousands of circumcisions across every age group. They also \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/courses/\\u0022\\u003etrain doctors in the UK and internationally\\u003c/a\\u003e in how to circumcise safely.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWhether you are here for religious, medical, cultural or personal reasons, the standard does not change: local anaesthetic every time, tested and shown to be working before we begin, and aftercare we explain to you and then give you in writing.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/process {\"items\":[{\"h\":\"You call, or ask us to call you\",\"p\":\"We answer the questions you have now, over the phone or on WhatsApp, and agree a consultation time. Plenty of people stop at this step, and that is a perfectly good outcome.\"},{\"h\":\"Consultation and examination\",\"p\":\"You meet the practitioner who would carry out the procedure. They examine, explain the method for your age group, go through the risks properly, and give you the price in writing. Nothing is booked unless you ask.\"},{\"h\":\"The day itself\",\"p\":\"Local anaesthetic, twenty to sixty minutes depending on age, and you go home a few hours later with written aftercare instructions and a number that reaches the clinic out of hours.\"},{\"h\":\"Afterwards\",\"p\":\"We telephone you the next day. Follow-up appointments are included until healing is complete, however many that takes, and we would far rather see you early than have you sitting at home worrying.\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/home-callback {\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA foreskin that does not pull back in a young boy is normal, and usually sorts itself out well into the teens. If that is the only reason you have booked, we will say so and send you home.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe will not proceed with a baby who is unwell or jaundiced, or who has a condition such as hypospadias where the foreskin may be needed for later reconstruction. If there is a tight frenulum and nothing else, a \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/procedures/frenuloplasty/\\u0022\\u003efrenuloplasty\\u003c/a\\u003e is the smaller and better operation. If you want to keep the foreskin, a \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/procedures/preputioplasty/\\u0022\\u003epreputioplasty\\u003c/a\\u003e may do the job instead.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThose conversations cost us bookings. They are also the reason people send us their brothers.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/reviews {\"body\":\"Most of our patients arrive because somebody they trust sent them. The families who come back are the part we are proudest of: some return after many years whenever there is a new son, others bring a brother, then a nephew, then a cousin. We have families we have now seen across three children and the better part of a decade.\",\"quotes\":[{\"name\":\"Mustafa Butt\",\"context\":\"Baby circumcision, three weeks old\",\"quote\":\"The receptionist explained the procedure clearly and put us at ease straight away. The doctor was thorough and professional, explained everything beforehand, and stayed calm and reassuring throughout. He took the time to go through the aftercare in detail.\"},{\"name\":\"Wajahat Murtaza\",\"context\":\"Baby circumcision\",\"quote\":\"Smooth and efficient from start to finish. Dr Haidar is professional and experienced, we were given all the information we needed, and a follow-up call was made as well, which is a nice thing to do. The ring came off after a week and my son is doing well.\"},{\"name\":\"Sara Salmanpour\",\"context\":\"Baby circumcision, two months old\",\"quote\":\"As first-time parents we were naturally anxious, but the team made us feel completely at ease. The doctor explained the procedure in detail and answered every concern with patience. They gave us the option to contact them any time afterwards, which was a huge relief.\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"our-clinics\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\" id=\"our-clinics\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Our clinics\",\"heading\":\"London, Luton, Southampton and Birmingham\",\"lede\":\"The London clinic in Edgware can be booked online. Luton, Southampton and Birmingham are booked by telephone.\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:html --><div class=\"grid g-4\"><div class=\"card\" data-reveal>\n        <span class=\"caps eyebrow\">London</span>\n        <h2 class=\"display d-3\">London — Edgware</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:12px\">Beverley Clinic<br>78 Beverley Drive, Edgware HA8 5NE</p>\n        <div class=\"btn-row\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\">Book a consultation</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\">View London clinic</a></div>\n      </div><div class=\"card\" data-reveal data-reveal-delay=\"80\">\n        <span class=\"caps eyebrow\">Luton</span>\n        <h2 class=\"display d-3\">Luton</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:12px\">Beverley Clinic<br>Liverpool Road Health Centre<br>Luton LU1 1HH</p>\n        <div class=\"btn-row\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/luton-circumcision-clinic/\">View Luton clinic</a></div>\n      </div><div class=\"card\" data-reveal data-reveal-delay=\"160\">\n        <span class=\"caps eyebrow\">Southampton</span>\n        <h2 class=\"display d-3\">Southampton</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:12px\">Beverley Clinic<br>Eastleigh Health Centre<br>Eastleigh SO50 9AG</p>\n        <div class=\"btn-row\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/southampton-circumcision-clinic/\">View Southampton clinic</a></div>\n      </div><div class=\"card\" data-reveal data-reveal-delay=\"240\">\n        <span class=\"caps eyebrow\">Birmingham</span>\n        <h2 class=\"display d-3\">Birmingham</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:12px\">Beverley Clinic<br>Soho Health Centre<br>Louise Road<br>Birmingham B21 9RY</p>\n        <div class=\"btn-row\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/birmingham-circumcision-clinic/\">View Birmingham clinic</a></div>\n      </div></div><!-- /wp:html --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/faq {\"heading\":\"The questions we are asked most\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Is the circumcision painful?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo. Every patient has local anaesthetic, at every age. It is safe, and it is illegal to circumcise without it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe do not simply assume it has worked. Once it has had time, we test the area and show you that no pain is felt, and we only begin once you tell us you are happy to proceed. Babies sometimes cry anyway: the anaesthetic removes pain but keeps ordinary touch sensation, which is painless, and an unfamiliar touch there is enough to make a baby object.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"How long does it take?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eFor a baby, the circumcision itself is about ten minutes, and the anaesthetic lasts around two hours afterwards. Older children and adults take longer. Allow about an hour for the visit either way, which covers the consultation, consent, the anaesthetic working and going through aftercare before you leave.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Which method do you use?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIt depends on age. For babies and toddlers we use the ring method, Plastibell or Circumplast, which needs no stitches and separates on its own within three to fourteen days. For older children and adults we use the forceps guided method with thermal cautery, which gives a clean line with minimal bleeding.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThere is no fixed cut-off age. We decide after examining.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"What is the best age?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eUnder one month old, if the choice is open to you. At that age it is quick and simple and healing is faster. We circumcise routinely at every age after that, right through to adults, so it is never too late.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you carry out religious circumcision?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes, and it is a large part of what we do. Our Muslim practitioners carry out the procedure according to the Sunnah, and we routinely cater for all faiths and backgrounds. \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/religious/\\u0022\\u003eMore about religious and cultural circumcision\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Can you correct a circumcision done elsewhere?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. Parents bring sons to us from across the UK and from abroad to tidy up work done somewhere else, and adults come for the same reason. It ranges from scar revision to tightening a loose result. \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/re-circumcision/\\u0022\\u003eMore about re-circumcision\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do I need to do anything to prepare?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eVery little, because it is done under local anaesthetic. There is no fasting. When you book we send you videos on how to prepare and what to expect from start to finish, and the page for your age group lists exactly what to bring.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Could the NHS do this instead?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWhere there is a medical need, yes, and if you can wait that is a reasonable choice. From what our patients tell us, the wait runs beyond a year. Religious and cultural circumcision is not funded. Start with your GP if you are unsure which applies to you.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->"
}
